---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
---
<Legal title="Refund policy" description="Fees paid to Sanchay Technologies are non-refundable once the service is activated." updated="20 November 2026">
  <div class="callout">
    <p><b>All fees are non-refundable once the service is activated.</b></p>
    <p>After your account, licence, white label setup or custom project has been activated, no refund is available, in full or in part.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>What "activated" means</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Platform plans and licences:</b> the moment the plan or licence is switched on for your account.</li>
    <li><b>White label:</b> once setup has started under your brand.</li>
    <li><b>Custom development:</b> once work has started on the agreed scope. Payments for completed milestones are final.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Why there are no refunds</h2>
  <p>
    Activation uses server capacity, broker connections, setup time and licences straight away, and trading results depend on the
    market, not on the software. For the same reason, trading losses or profits are never a ground for a refund.
  </p>

  <h2>Before you pay</h2>
  <p>
    Ask us for a demo before you buy. We are happy to walk you through the platform so you know exactly what you are getting.
  </p>

  <h2>Duplicate or wrong payments</h2>
  <p>
    If you were charged twice for the same thing or paid before activation by mistake, email <a href="mailto:info@sanchaytechnologies.com">info@sanchaytechnologies.com</a> within 7 days with the payment details. We will check and return a confirmed duplicate
    payment to the original payment method.
  </p>

  <h2>Cancellation</h2>
  <p>You can stop renewal at any time. Access continues until the end of the period already paid for.</p>
</Legal>
